Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), matching the terms under which the thesis is
deposited in the UVic-UCC institutional repository (RIUVic).

You may share and adapt these documents for non-commercial purposes,
